    "formal": "\\forall n,d\\in\\mathbb{N}:\\ (\\mathrm{birthdayCount3}\\ n\\ d : \\mathbb{Z}) = \\sum_{k=0}^{\\lfloor n/2\\rfloor} (-1)^k\\, T(n,k)\\, d^{\\,n-k},\\ T(n,0)=1, where T(n,k) encode the involution / telephone-number structure; establish the coefficient recurrence and prove by induction on n, generalizing d, d^2, d^3-d, d^4-4d^2+3d.",
