    "insights": [
      "General closed form birthdayCount3 n d = Σ_p C(n,2p)·(2p-1)‼·(d)_{n-p} proved for ALL n (parent only did n=1..4), 0 sorry / 0 axiom",
      "EGF birthdayCount3 n d = n!·[x^n](1+x+x²/2)^d; grouping by p doubly-occupied days gives the perfect-matching/falling-factorial formula (division-free over ℕ)",
      "Single-day ladder identity R n e (s+1) = R n e s + n·R(n-1) e s is the key: extracts a two-parameter recurrence without carrying (e,s) state; proved by strong induction, residual closed by linear_combination over ℤ",
      "Two-term recurrence birthdayCount3(n+1)d = d·(bc3 n (d-1) + n·bc3 (n-1)(d-1)); the closed form satisfying it reduces coefficient-wise to Pascal + absorption k·C(n,k)=n·C(n-1,k-1)"
    ],
